"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"Replaces the solid purple main navbar of the backend with a light one,\n"
"separated from the page by a thin line. Menu entries use the regular\n"
"text colors and the brand color is kept for the name of the current app.\n"
"\n"
"A strongly colored bar draws the eye away from the content on every\n"
"screen. A light navbar keeps the focus on the view below it, and is\n"
"closer to what most web applications use today.\n"
"\n"
"Only the navbar variables of ``web`` are overridden, so the module is\n"
"easy to review, to combine with other modules and to uninstall.\n"
"\n"
